# Webhook Configuration

## Description

This webhook is used to receive realtime sensor data
for the AI Agriculture Monitoring System.

## Method

POST

## Expected Payload

```json
{
  "soil_moisture": 68,
  "nitrogen": 45,
  "phosphorus": 32,
  "potassium": 51
}
```

## Workflow Process

1. Receive sensor data
2. Fetch weather information
3. Generate AI recommendation
4. Save report to Google Sheets
5. Send Telegram notification

## Security Note

Webhook URL is stored securely using environment variables
and is not exposed publicly.
